---
description: A Theming API theme and the legacy CSS theme files are both in use on the same page.
---

## Mixed Theming Approaches

In v33 the default approach to theming AG Grid has been updated to use the [Theming API](./theming). This error occurs when a theme is set via the `theme` property but the legacy CSS files have not been removed.

